# The product name is deliberately left in English in every locale: it is the name the
# add-on carries in the Add-on Store, in the configuration directory and in its documentation.
#. Translators: The title of the add-on's confirmation dialogs: the product name,
#. which is not translated in any locale.
#. Translators: The name of the category this add-on's commands appear under
#. in NVDA's Input Gestures dialog.
#. Add-on summary/title, usually the user visible name of the add-on
#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
msgid "Axygen Checklist"
msgstr "Axygen Checklist"

#. Translators: The status of a checklist item that has been checked and works.
msgid "passed"
msgstr "пройдено"

#. Translators: The status of a checklist item that has been checked and does not work.
msgid "failed"
msgstr "провалено"

#. Translators: The status of a checklist item that could not be checked because
#. something else is in the way.
msgid "blocked"
msgstr "заблоковано"

#. Translators: The status of a checklist item that was deliberately left unchecked.
msgid "skipped"
msgstr "пропущено"

#. Translators: The status of a checklist item that has not been checked yet.
msgid "not checked"
msgstr "не перевірено"

#. Translators: Spoken after the status of a checklist item the tester has
#. commented on. The comment itself is not spoken; the item dialog shows it.
msgid "has a comment"
msgstr "є коментар"

#. Translators: Spoken when a checklist file was written by a newer version of
#. the add-on than the one running, which cannot know what is in it.
msgid "This file was created by a newer version of the add-on"
msgstr "Файл створено новішою версією додатка"

#. Translators: Spoken when a checklist file cannot be read, or holds something
#. that is not a valid checklist.
msgid "Error reading the file"
msgstr "Помилка читання файлу"

#. Translators: Spoken when a change to the checklist could not be written to the
#. file, so it is in memory but not on disk.
msgid "Error writing the file"
msgstr "Помилка запису файлу"

# The first form covers 1, 21, 31 and so on, where "всі" reads as a flourish in
# Ukrainian too; the other two carry it.
#. Translators: Spoken when the last item of a checklist has been given a
#. status, so nothing in it is left unchecked. {count} is how many items
#. the checklist holds. The word "All" is dropped from the singular, where
#. it reads as a flourish over a count of one.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Checklist complete! {count} item processed"
msgid_plural "Checklist complete! All {count} items processed"
msgstr[0] "Чекліст завершено! Опрацьовано {count} пункт"
msgstr[1] "Чекліст завершено! Опрацьовано всі {count} пункти"
msgstr[2] "Чекліст завершено! Опрацьовано всі {count} пунктів"

#. Translators: Spoken for the current section of the checklist: its name, how many
#. of its items carry a verdict, and how many it holds in all.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Section: {name}, {processed} of {total} processed"
msgstr "Розділ: {name}, опрацьовано {processed} з {total}"

#. Translators: Added after a count of checklist items when some of them failed,
#. running straight on from it: "All 12 items processed, 2 failed".
#, python-brace-format
msgid ", {count} failed"
msgstr ", провалено {count}"

#. Translators: Spoken when NVDA starts and the checklist that was open
#. last time is no longer where it was.
msgid "Checklist file not found"
msgstr "Файл чекліста не знайдено"

#. Translators: The description of a command, as it appears in NVDA's Input Gestures dialog.
msgid ""
"Moves to the next item of the checklist. Twice: to the first item of the "
"next section"
msgstr ""
"Переходить до наступного пункту чекліста. Двічі — до першого пункту "
"наступного розділу"

#. Translators: The description of a command, as it appears in NVDA's Input Gestures dialog.
msgid ""
"Moves to the previous item of the checklist. Twice: to the first item of the "
"previous section"
msgstr ""
"Переходить до попереднього пункту чекліста. Двічі — до першого пункту "
"попереднього розділу"

#. Translators: The description of a command, as it appears in NVDA's Input Gestures dialog.
msgid ""
"Marks the current checklist item as passed, or as not checked if it passed "
"already"
msgstr ""
"Позначає поточний пункт чекліста пройденим, а вже пройдений повертає в «не "
"перевірено»"

#. Translators: The description of a command, as it appears in NVDA's Input Gestures dialog.
msgid "Reads the current item of the checklist again"
msgstr "Повторює озвучення поточного пункту чекліста"

#. Translators: The description of a command, as it appears in NVDA's Input Gestures dialog.
msgid "Arms the command mode of the checklist for three seconds"
msgstr "Озброює режим команд чекліста на три секунди"

#. Translators: The description of a command, as it appears in NVDA's Input Gestures dialog.
msgid ""
"Reads the name of the current section of the checklist and the progress "
"through it"
msgstr "Озвучує назву поточного розділу чекліста та прогрес у ньому"

#. Translators: The description of a command, as it appears in NVDA's Input Gestures dialog.
msgid ""
"Resets the current section of the checklist, erasing its statuses and "
"comments"
msgstr "Скидає поточний розділ чекліста, стираючи його статуси й коментарі"

#. Translators: The question asked before the current section of the checklist
#. is reset, that is every item put back to not checked and every comment erased.
msgid ""
"Reset the section? Every status and comment in the section will be erased. "
"This cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Скинути розділ? Будуть стерті всі статуси та коментарі розділу. Цю дію не "
"можна відмінити."

#. Translators: Spoken when there is no section after this one to jump to.
msgid "End of list"
msgstr "Кінець списку"

#. Translators: Spoken when there is no section before this one to jump to.
msgid "Start of list"
msgstr "Початок списку"

#. Translators: Spoken after the current section of the checklist has been reset.
msgid "Section reset"
msgstr "Розділ скинуто"

#. Translators: Spoken when a command is used before a checklist has been opened.
msgid "No checklist loaded"
msgstr "Чекліст не завантажено"

#. Translators: Spoken when a command is used on a checklist whose sections
#. are all empty, so there is no item to stand on.
msgid "The checklist has no items"
msgstr "У чеклісті немає пунктів"

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
msgid ""
"Walk a test checklist with global commands while the system focus stays in "
"the application under test.\n"
"Items are marked passed, failed or skipped, commented and read back by "
"speech, without ever leaving the window being tested.\n"
"Checklists are plain JSON files that record the result of the run."
msgstr ""
"Проходить чекліст тестування глобальними командами, лишаючи системний фокус "
"у тестованому застосунку.\n"
"Пункти позначаються як пройдені, провалені чи пропущені, коментуються та "
"озвучуються — не полишаючи вікна, яке перевіряють.\n"
"Чеклісти є звичайними файлами JSON, що зберігають результат прогону."

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
msgid "First development version."
msgstr "Перша версія в розробці."

